# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit a real token.
#
# This file is the source of truth: it overrides any GITEA_TOKEN already
# exported in your shell. Plain unquoted values only — surrounding quotes would
# become part of the token, and `#` or `$` in a value need escaping.
#
# Codeberg access token, Settings -> Applications -> Access Tokens.
# Minimum scope: write:repository (create releases, upload attachments).
GITEA_TOKEN=
